              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2026.11 —</td>
              <td>
                <a href="/projects/ecological-cool-island/">
                  <span class="t-zh">生态冷岛网络（在冷岛网络基础上延伸）</span>
                  <span class="t-en">Ecological cool-island network, extending the previous work</span>
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2026.04 — 2026.10</td>
              <td>
                <a href="/projects/wuzhen-twin-gate/">
                  <span class="t-zh">乌镇东栅 / 西栅 旅游资源转换效率与游客情感（大创，已结题）</span>
                  <span class="t-en">Resource-use efficiency and visitor sentiment at Wuzhen's two gates (programme, completed)</span>
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2><span class="t-zh">成果</span><span class="t-en">Output</span></h2>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>2026</td>
              <td>
                <span class="t-zh">软件著作权：DEA 分析工作台系统（2026SR1091537）</span>
                <span class="t-en">Software copyright: DEA Analysis Workbench (2026SR1091537)</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2><span class="t-zh">待补</span><span class="t-en">To be filled</span></h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <span class="t-zh">课程列表与成绩</span><span class="t-en">Coursework and grades</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t-zh">获奖、实习与学术活动</span><span class="t-en">Awards, internships, academic activities</span>
